# Trivy allowlist (Step 3.3 / plan Step 22).
#
# Policy: CI fails on *fixable* HIGH/CRITICAL findings in the images we build
# (--ignore-unfixed handles the unfixable ones automatically). Anything listed
# here must carry a reason and an expiry date; when the date passes, the entry
# is treated as a failure — either fix it or consciously re-approve it.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-XXXX-YYYY  # <reason> — expires YYYY-MM-DD
#
# (empty — no exceptions currently)
